  "body": "<!-- ⚠️ If you do not respect this template, your issue will be closed -->\r\n<!-- ⚠️ Make sure to browse the opened and closed issues to confirm this idea does not exist. -->\r\n\r\n### What is the expected enhancement?\r\n\r\n#147 also suggest some general improvements to the drivers. The implementation of these is tracked by this issue:\r\n\r\n- [x] relocate `qiskit_nature.drivers.*` into `qiskit_nature.drivers.second_quantization.*`\r\n- [x] relocate `qiskit_nature.transformers.*` into `qiskit_nature.transformers.second_quantization.*`\r\n- [x] check the \"file\"-based drivers for general improvements:\r\n  - [x] `fcidumpd`\r\n  - [x] `hdf5d`\r\n- [x] check the \"program\"-based drivers for general improvements:\r\n  - [x] `pyscfd`\r\n  - [x] `pyquanted`\r\n  - [x] `psi4d`\r\n  - [x] `gaussiand`\r\n\r\nWhile performing the checks for general improvments we should also check for the ability of the driver to perform more input validation and update the documentation of all methods.",
